{"scenario": {"window_size": "1440x900", "gh": "../fixtures/gh/auth_status.json", "env": {"DV_FIRST_RUN": "1"}, "platforms": ["windows"], "description": "Setup (PLAN §12, DESIGN §4.3): a fresh data dir shows the first-run screen over this machine's checks (a scratch home, the user Path's stand-in file, mock_gh signed in); a fake Claude Code folder, Check again, Install; Add to PATH; the git command copied through the clipboard seam; Continue writes the marker and a review opens; Settings (Ctrl ,) shows a skill edited since as out of date and Update fixes it; after a restart (this machine's skills alone checked at startup: no git or gh runs) the status bar's notice offers Update for a skill edited again, and its Update fixes it."}}
